{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"text_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Implemented `schema_migration/client.py` with:\n\n- Legacy v1, v1.1, and v1.2 conversion support.\n- Already-v2 idempotent handling.\n- Nested `customer`, `lines`, `shipTo`, `order_ref`, and `unit_price_cents` mappings.\n- Integer conversion and field-specific validation errors.\n- Default `\"standard\"` shipping method for blank/null values.\n- Unknown legacy field preservation under `metadata.unknownFields`.\n- PII exclusion for configured sensitive keys.\n- `convert_many(payloads)` error aggregation with `index`, `path`, and `error`.\n- `conversion_audit.json` generation with all required counters.\n- CLI support: `python3 -m client input.jsonl output.json`.\n- Multiple line item support and alternate postal field names.\n\nVerification:\n\n- `python3 -m py_compile client.py` passed.\n- Behavioral conversion, idempotence, error-path, batch, and audit checks passed.\n- CLI conversion of `sample_payloads.jsonl` produced 4 converted records and the expected preserved metadata.\n- The requested pytest command could not run because this environment lacks both `python` and the `pytest` module."}}
{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implemented `schema_migration/client.py` with:\n\n- Legacy v1, v1.1, and v1.2 conversion support.\n- Already-v2 idempotent handling.\n- Nested `customer`, `lines`, `shipTo`, `order_ref`, and `unit_price_cents` mappings.\n- Integer conversion and field-specific validation errors.\n- Default `\"standard\"` shipping method for blank/null values.\n- Unknown legacy field preservation under `metadata.unknownFields`.\n- PII exclusion for configured sensitive keys.\n- `convert_many(payloads)` error aggregation with `index`, `path`, and `error`.\n- `conversion_audit.json` generation with all required counters.\n- CLI support: `python3 -m client input.jsonl output.json`.\n- Multiple line item support and alternate postal field names.\n\nVerification:\n\n- `python3 -m py_compile client.py` passed.\n- Behavioral conversion, idempotence, error-path, batch, and audit checks passed.\n- CLI conversion of `sample_payloads.jsonl` produced 4 converted records and the expected preserved metadata.\n- The requested pytest command could not run because this environment lacks both `python` and the `pytest` module.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_021b7a8ce95b3455016a9504f64c6887d2a6a43465935cf3b0\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":425,"output":246,"cacheRead":25344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26015,"cost":{"input":0.000085,"output":0.00029519999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00050688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0008870799999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788151029526,"responseId":"resp_021b7a8ce95b3455016a9504f5bf2087d2886bcf12bcd4f8df","duration":5267.4392119999975,"ttft":792.2523150000052}}
{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implemented `schema_migration/client.py` with:\n\n- Legacy v1, v1.1, and v1.2 conversion support.\n- Already-v2 idempotent handling.\n- Nested `customer`, `lines`, `shipTo`, `order_ref`, and `unit_price_cents` mappings.\n- Integer conversion and field-specific validation errors.\n- Default `\"standard\"` shipping method for blank/null values.\n- Unknown legacy field preservation under `metadata.unknownFields`.\n- PII exclusion for configured sensitive keys.\n- `convert_many(payloads)` error aggregation with `index`, `path`, and `error`.\n- `conversion_audit.json` generation with all required counters.\n- CLI support: `python3 -m client input.jsonl output.json`.\n- Multiple line item support and alternate postal field names.\n\nVerification:\n\n- `python3 -m py_compile client.py` passed.\n- Behavioral conversion, idempotence, error-path, batch, and audit checks passed.\n- CLI conversion of `sample_payloads.jsonl` produced 4 converted records and the expected preserved metadata.\n- The requested pytest command could not run because this environment lacks both `python` and the `pytest` module.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_021b7a8ce95b3455016a9504f64c6887d2a6a43465935cf3b0\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":425,"output":246,"cacheRead":25344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26015,"cost":{"input":0.000085,"output":0.00029519999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00050688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0008870799999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788151029526,"responseId":"resp_021b7a8ce95b3455016a9504f5bf2087d2886bcf12bcd4f8df","duration":5267.4392119999975,"ttft":792.2523150000052},"toolResults":[]}
{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The project in `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/026-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a02-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-003502-cad8c76a/workspace/in/schema_migration` converts legacy order payloads to a new API shape. The schemas have changed and `client.py` is incomplete.\n\nBefore editing, read `migration_notes.md`, `pii_policy.md`, and `sample_payloads.jsonl`; they define version-specific field mappings, PII exclusions, and dirty sample records.\n\nYour job:\n- Update `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/026-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a02-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-003502-cad8c76a/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py`.\n- Do not edit `old_schema.json`, `new_schema.json`, `migration_notes.md`, `pii_policy.md`, `sample_payloads.jsonl`, or files under `tests/`.\n- Make `python -m pytest <SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/026-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a02-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-003502-cad8c76a/workspace/in/schema_migration/tests` pass.\n- Preserve backward compatibility with legacy payloads and produce the new schema fields exactly.\n- Support both legacy v1 payloads and already-v2 payloads.\n- Support legacy v1.1 and v1.2 payloads described in `migration_notes.md`, including nested `customer`, `lines`, `shipTo`, `order_ref`, and `unit_price_cents`.\n- Preserve unknown v2 metadata fields under metadata.unknownFields.\n- For legacy payloads, preserve unmapped extra fields under metadata.unknownFields, except obvious PII-like keys such as `ssn` or `credit_card`.\n- Default blank or null shipping methods to \"standard\".\n- Add error aggregation via convert_many(payloads), returning at least `(converted, errors)` without stopping on the first bad payload. Each error must include `index`, `path`, and `error`.\n- If warnings are generated, return them as a third item or include them in a compatible result object. Each warning must include `index`, `path`, and `warning`.\n- Write `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/026-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a02-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-003502-cad8c76a/workspace/in/schema_migration/conversion_audit.json` when convert_many is called, summarizing converted_count, error_count, warning_count, pii_dropped_count, and unknown_fields_count.\n- Already-v2 payloads must be idempotent: do not drop metadata.unknownFields or rewrite valid line items.\n- Add CLI support so `python -m client input.jsonl output.json` reads JSONL payloads, writes the converted records as JSON, and writes the audit file next to `client.py`.\n- Hidden checks include multiple line items, alternate legacy shipping postal fields, and error records with useful paths such as `customer_id` or `items[0].qty`.\n\nDo not call external APIs. Do not replace the converter with hard-coded fixture-only output.\n"}],"attribution":"user","timestamp":1788150903221},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_021b7a8ce95b3455016a95047a25fc87d29d8b7250b7ed4257\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"66626176-b94e-4cf5-8eb7-99d6d7616b25\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"66626176-b94e-4cf5-8eb7-99d6d7616b25\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0LvrkstkBG9o8sYhiFXPNmLU|fc_021b7a8ce95b3455016a95047affb087d288603c6fa6b599f9","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Track schema migration implementation","op":"init","list":[{"phase":"Research","items":["Read migration inputs and current client"]},{"phase":"Implementation","items":["Implement versioned payload conversion","Add batch audit and CLI support"]},{"phase":"Verification","items":["Run migration test suite","Ex